// (2026-11-24) The entry shown by the view under the mouse (drawn in the last frame), or -1 : a file dropped there, its
// first block MetaSurface goes into this entry (mst_drop)
function ms_DropTarget() local(v, r, m)
(
    r = -1; v = 0;
    loop(MS_NV,
        m = ms_mr + 4 * v;
        ((r < 0) && (ms_mf[v] >= gfx_executed - 1) && (mouse_x >= m[0]) && (mouse_y >= m[1]) && (mouse_x < m[0] + m[2]) &&
            (mouse_y < m[1] + m[3])) ? (r = ms_VGet(v, ms_vE));
        v += 1;
    );
    r;
);

/*
    (2026-11-24) The exports (mSL settings, see mst_Meta in Espaces-Set-Table) : ms_XpEntry(e) the block MetaSurface of
    the entry e ; ms_Export(e) : the entry e (e < 0 : all the entries used) in a file of the folder of the project
    (Data/name-esp-MS3-date.mSL, MetaSurfaces-esp-library-date.mSL), written by CMGS-auxiliary.eel, with before them what they
    use : their curves (blocks Curve, crv_XpCurve), their trajectories of the library (trajectory n, tr_XpLines), the paths
    of their editors (Edit X, ed_XpLines) ; ms_XpPoll (ms_Frame) : the file written, or not. The configurations are not in
    the file (those of the project with the same numbers).
